      "id": "46f7daadcc5d930ca97925d96f05baddb20e1b2f",
      "message": "\ud83d\ude91 fix: run evidence writers after probe builds\n\nThe browser and rejection gates rewrite tracked evidence, so running them before probe production trips its strict clean-source guard. Move both gates after package/probe builds and before all uploads. A disposable Git regression preserves the source guard and proves fresh evidence remains available before publication.",
